Runs thin-edge.io on the router to connect it to Cumulocity IoT. thin-edge.io is
a lightweight, open-source IoT edge framework: it registers the device in the
cloud, forwards telemetry and events, and enables remote management such as
configuration, log collection, software updates and remote commands.

The app bundles a self-contained thin-edge.io "standalone" runtime (the tedge
multi-call binary plus a statically linked Mosquitto MQTT broker) so it has no
external dependencies. The secure connection to the cloud is handled by
thin-edge.io's built-in MQTT bridge over TLS.

Configure the Cumulocity URL and device registration details on this module's
configuration page, enable the module, and thin-edge.io will start automatically
on boot.
